#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0691 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "dataset ADLBC WITHOUT class= and WITHOUT SPDEVID -> detected [BDS] only (SPDEVID is the device discriminator column and it is absent). Scope.Data_Structures.Include [MEDICAL DEVICE BASIC DATA STRUCTURE] rejects a plain BDS -> skipped (Fix #179 is-a direction: base-scoped covers device, device-scoped does NOT cover base)."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col BASE    type=Num
col BASEC   type=Char
col ABLFL   type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | GLUC | 5.2 | 5.1 | | N
